# React hooks

Follow `doc/hooks.md`.

- Obey Rules of Hooks.
- Shared hooks → `src/hooks/`; feature-only hooks → `src/features/<domain>/hooks/` when reused.
- Do not scatter new `AppState` listeners; share one lifecycle hook if needed.
